1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:02,600
BAMBANG: "Dik Dimas!" teriak Pak Bambang.

2
00:00:02,620 --> 00:00:04,600
SEKAR: "Mas Dimas!" sahut Bu Sekar.

3
00:00:04,620 --> 00:00:06,920
DIMAS: "Aku cuma WALI KOTA!" teriakku.

4
00:00:06,940 --> 00:00:08,190
DIMAS (batin): Kok bisa begini?

5
00:00:09,085 --> 00:00:12,665
DIMAS (batin): Tiga tahun lalu... kota ini tenggelam tiap Februari.

6
00:00:12,835 --> 00:00:13,985
DIMAS (batin): Banjir.

7
00:00:14,045 --> 00:00:15,195
DIMAS (batin): Sampah.

8
00:00:15,355 --> 00:00:16,505
DIMAS (batin): Pungli.

9
00:00:16,655 --> 00:00:19,105
DIMAS (batin): Kata orang... nggak bisa dibenerin.

10
00:00:19,425 --> 00:00:23,715
DIMAS (batin): Aku dulu cuma ojol... yang hobi lapor jalan bolong.

11
00:00:23,935 --> 00:00:26,795
DIMAS (batin): Laporanku nggak pernah dibalas.

12
00:00:27,015 --> 00:00:30,075
DIMAS (batin): Jadi aku nyalon sendiri... Modal patungan warga.

13
00:00:30,345 --> 00:00:32,285
WARGA: "Pak Wali!" panggil warga.

14
00:00:32,305 --> 00:00:36,265
DIMAS (batin): Sekarang umurku 28... dan aku wali kotanya.

15
00:00:36,285 --> 00:00:38,785
DIMAS (batin): Di Nusa Wacana, itu sah.

16
00:00:45,210 --> 00:00:49,980
IBU: Malam itu Ibu bilang, "Makan dulu, Le. Wali kota juga butuh gorengan."

17
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:52,018
DIMAS: "Iya, Bu," jawabku.

18
00:00:54,085 --> 00:00:56,805
IBU: "Siapa, Le?" tanya Ibu, tanpa menoleh.

19
00:00:56,825 --> 00:00:59,935
DIMAS: "...Calon presiden, Bu," bisikku.

20
00:01:00,255 --> 00:01:05,955
BAMBANG: "Dik Dimas! Anak muda kayak kamu itu... LAKU," kata Pak Bambang.

21
00:01:05,975 --> 00:01:10,615
BAMBANG: "Jadi wakil saya, ya? Besok pagi saya tunggu jawabannya," katanya lagi.

22
00:01:10,635 --> 00:01:13,476
IBU: Ibu cuma bilang, "Gorengan, Pak?"

23
00:01:15,960 --> 00:01:19,700
SEKAR: "Mas Dimas. Jangan jawab Bambang dulu," kata Bu Sekar.

24
00:01:19,720 --> 00:01:23,530
BAMBANG: "Lho, Sekar?!" kata Pak Bambang, mulutnya penuh tempe.

25
00:01:23,550 --> 00:01:26,960
SEKAR: "Tawaran saya... jauh lebih baik," kata Bu Sekar.

26
00:01:29,380 --> 00:01:32,870
IBU: Lalu Ibu bilang... "Le... tempenya gosong."

27
00:01:33,190 --> 00:01:36,110
DIMAS (batin): Malam ini... aku harus jawab apa?

